Rulings (AskUserQuestion 1007): InitSpeed > JogHighSpeed is flagged, EastSun fixes Mot_Table (no raise / clamp); live writes from the
first run. Plan D:\HT9045\_paramsync_1007\PLAN_PARAMSYNC.md. Measured 1007: 128 "SetSpeed ... FAILED" route lines, four causes:
 A golden's boot SetMotorSpeed runs before the 1203 route exists -> the PTP speeds never reached the card at boot;
 B the boot InitMotor wrote CFG_AxMaxAcc/Dec from the runtime dAcc (MInArmX 1000 = 1 %), golden uses 100 % (cinitial.cpp:3616 -> :3643),
   so every later PAR_AxAcc/Dec above it was refused (0x80000013/14);
 C the route's SetSpeedParam had no ceiling step (HOME / Motor Test have one), failures only logged;
 E W906_BootInitMotorTick was reachable only from the modal wait (W906_BrakeAxisTick) -> boot InitMotor ran at 09:01 / 09:36 only
   (a box was up), not for the 09:48 / 10:xx runs;
 D Mot_Table: MInArmY 50000 > 20000, MOutArmX 80000 > 15000, MOutShuttle1 40000 > 6000 (InitSpeed > JogHighSpeed) -> 0x80000011/12.

- WebMotorAccess.cpp MotorAccessBootInitMotor (same line): CFG_AxMaxAcc/Dec = accDb/decDb (100 %) on the boot path only.
- EtherCAT/Pci1203MotorRoute.cpp SetSpeedParam (same line): an Acc/Dec (PTP or jog) above a KNOWN acc/dec ceiling raises it first
  (never lowered; unknown = written as before); velocity ceilings not raised (ruling). EOF: Pci1203MotorRouteSpeedVerify -- read-only
  compare of every successful write with the monitor's fresh read-back (ok / mismatch / unverified).
- WebMotorAccessLive.cpp: boot InitMotor + W906_ParamSyncTick on the main loop too (W906_MotorAccessPollTick, same line);
  W906_ParamSyncTick (EOF) runs golden SetMotorSpeed() once after every boot InitMotor is done, and on the rising edge of the
  fMotorTest / fTeach page (port-only, EastSun's request); waits while SystemStart / SoftStart / iHome / Home Monitor; PTP only
  (SetSpeed bSetJog=false) so a Motor Test JOG keeps the page's speed; 1.5 s later logs PARAMSYNC: failed writes, read-back counts,
  mismatches, and the Mot_Table rows with InitSpeed > JogHighSpeed.
- Tests: test_pci1203_motor_route P (a fake card that refuses above its ceilings like the real one; MInArmX 1007 numbers: 0 failed,
  ceiling raised first, never lowered, velocity not raised -> 0x80000012, unknown ceiling plain, verify ok / mismatch / unverified)
  271/271; test_web_motor_access boot InitMotor MaxAcc/Dec = 100 % (1099/0). EcatMotorRoute, AtcBootInit, Pci1203Pure passed.
Debug wb_serve linked (program not running). Scan 0.

